827
00:47:16.845 --> 00:47:17.711
What about your parents?

828
00:47:17.712 --> 00:47:19.044
They're both busy with work.

829
00:47:19.045 --> 00:47:20.711
They don't come back until after midnight

830
00:47:20.712 --> 00:47:22.727
