895
00:51:24.195 --> 00:51:24.777
You scared me!

896
00:51:24.778 --> 00:51:25.710
Jun, Jun, Jun!

897
00:51:25.734 --> 00:51:26.577
It's the damn Jun again!

898
00:51:27.578 --> 00:51:28.744
Damn Jun!

899
00:51:29.945 --> 00:51:31.444
