959
00:53:14.762 --> 00:53:16.061
Your husband...

960
00:53:16.812 --> 00:53:18.144
He used the house as collateral to buy stocks.

961
00:53:18.145 --> 00:53:19.727
What does that have to do with this?

962
00:53:19.728 --> 00:53:20.694
