1019
00:55:06.929 --> 00:55:08.278
'60 Seconds'...

1020
00:55:09.471 --> 00:55:11.436
Sister-in-law, that tattoo on your arm...

1021
00:55:13.029 --> 00:55:13.974
Who is this guy?

1022
00:55:13.999 --> 00:55:16.028
Just someone I know.

1023
00:55:16.029 --> 00:55:18.573
